---
description: >-
  BT gitGraph with two separate cherry-pick operations — one from develop and one from a nested
  featureA branch — combined with a later merge of featureA into develop, testing multiple
  cherry-picks alongside branching and merging.
---
gitGraph BT:
  commit id: "ZERO"
  branch develop
  commit id:"A"
  checkout main
  commit id:"ONE"
  checkout develop
  commit id:"B"
  branch featureA
  commit id:"FIX"
  commit id: "FIX-2"
  checkout main
  commit id:"TWO"
  cherry-pick id:"A"
  commit id:"THREE"
  cherry-pick id:"FIX"
  checkout develop
  commit id:"C"
  merge featureA
